Owner decision 2026-10-11 (docs/blueprint/owner-decisions-2026-10-11.md). 2026-10-18 (lane L13): not changed; the root variable is a protected path, and the module-only alternative (hard-coding HSM in modules/binaryauthorization) would plan a billed HSM attestor version into applied dev. The variables.tf patch is in lane L13's report. It remains an owner decision: applying the patch puts dev's deploy-signing (attestor) key on a billed HSM key version. The full protected-path patch for infrastructure/terraform/variables.tf, verbatim:

# R12-SEC-10053 (owner decision D12, ADR 0110 Amendment 1): protected-path patch
# for infrastructure/terraform/variables.tf, not applied by lane L13.
# Replace `variable "kms_protection_level"` (variables.tf:1061-1077) with:

variable "signing_key_protection_level" {
  description = "Protection level for every signing key (the Binary Authorization attestor). HSM in every environment (D12)."
  type        = string
  default     = "HSM"

  validation {
    condition     = var.signing_key_protection_level == "HSM"
    error_message = "signing_key_protection_level must be exactly \"HSM\": D12 puts every signing key on an HSM in every environment."
  }
}

variable "cmek_protection_level" {
  description = "Protection level for every encryption (CMEK) key: SOFTWARE is admitted in dev and test only; stage and prod are HSM (D12)."
  type        = string
  default     = "HSM"

  validation {
    condition     = contains(["SOFTWARE", "HSM"], var.cmek_protection_level)
    error_message = "cmek_protection_level must be exactly \"SOFTWARE\" or \"HSM\"; EXTERNAL and EXTERNAL_VPC need a google_kms_ekm_connection this configuration does not declare."
  }

  validation {
    condition     = var.cmek_protection_level == "HSM" || contains(["dev", "test"], var.environment)
    error_message = "cmek_protection_level SOFTWARE is admitted only in dev and test; stage and prod encryption keys are HSM (D12)."
  }
}

# main.tf: pass `kms_protection_level = var.signing_key_protection_level` to
# module "binaryauthorization", and `kms_protection_level = var.cmek_protection_level`
# to modules secrets, registry, backup, evidence and build-pool (their own
# variables keep the name). environments/{dev,test}/terraform.tfvars:
# `cmek_protection_level = "SOFTWARE"` where `kms_protection_level` is set today.
# tests/kms-protection.tftest.hcl: expect_failures on
# var.signing_key_protection_level = "SOFTWARE" (any env) and on
# var.cmek_protection_level = "SOFTWARE" with environment = "stage" and "prod";
# assert plans admit SOFTWARE CMEK in dev and test. Applying it puts the dev
# attestor on an HSM key version, which is billed: an owner apply.
